  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 130, right: 60, fontSize: 330, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EFF8', lineHeight: 1 }}>04</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 200, left: 80, width: 760, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 4, background: '#FFC107' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 5 }}>CHAPTER 04</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 18 }}>实验验证与下一步</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 34, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 11 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7, flex: 1 }}>
          exp01 多 seed 阶梯：改进方向 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3/3 seed 一致</span>、可逐位复现，幅度 seed-dependent
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 11 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7, flex: 1 }}>
          exp02 规模标定：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>求解规模与任务规模 N 解耦</span>，瓶颈定位到选择名额而非候选比例
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 30 }}>
      评估口径：长程滚动 24 周期、Poisson λ=5 到达；「任务不被完成只有物理约束被违反」——完成只认物理约束，迟到折价而非废飞。所有数字来自实验 metrics 原始记录。
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '7px 16px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>P12 · exp01</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ padding: '7px 16px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>P13 · exp02</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ padding: '7px 16px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>P14 · 性能瓶颈</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ padding: '7px 16px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>P15 · 边界与计划</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 480, right: 80, width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
    {['按时率 93.3% ± 3.6', '完成 60/60 · 废飞 0', '求解规模与 N 解耦'].map((k) => (
      <Box key={k} style={{ padding: '8px 18px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 18, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
